"Keep Awake" = "保持唤醒";
"Indefinitely" = "无限期";
"Keep Awake for %@" = "保持唤醒 %@";
"Deactivate" = "停用";
"Activate" = "启用";
"While Keeping Awake" = "保持唤醒时";
"Keep Display Awake" = "保持显示器唤醒";
"Block Lid-Close Sleep" = "合盖不睡眠";
"Block Lid-Close Sleep…" = "合盖不睡眠…";
"Waiting for Administrator Approval…" = "正在等待管理员授权…";
"Quit Espresso" = "退出 Espresso";
"Keep awake duration" = "保持唤醒时长";
"Keep the Mac awake with the lid closed during sessions (on by default, AC or battery). Releases automatically when the session ends, Espresso quits, or Low Power Mode turns on." = "会话期间合上盖子时也保持 Mac 唤醒（默认开启，接电源或用电池均可）。会话结束、退出 Espresso 或开启低电量模式时自动解除。";

