/* Lid-block setup */
"Allow Espresso to block lid-close sleep?" = "允许 Espresso 阻止合盖睡眠？";
"This needs a one-time administrator approval. Espresso adds a rule that lets it run only “pmset disablesleep” without a password, so it can always release the block on its own when a session ends, you quit, or Low Power Mode turns on." = "这需要管理员一次性授权。Espresso 会添加一条规则，只允许它免密码运行“pmset disablesleep”，这样在会话结束、退出 Espresso 或开启低电量模式时，它总能自行解除阻止。";
"Set Up…" = "设置…";
"Not Now" = "以后再说";
"Espresso needs your password once so it can block lid-close sleep. It will only be allowed to run “pmset disablesleep”." = "Espresso 需要你输入一次密码，以便阻止合盖睡眠。它只会被允许运行“pmset disablesleep”。";
"Setup didn't complete" = "设置未完成";
"You can add the rule by hand in Terminal:" = "你也可以在“终端”中手动添加这条规则：";
"Lid-close blocking is still unavailable" = "合盖不睡眠仍不可用";
"Espresso installed its rule at %@, but “sudo -n pmset disablesleep” still asks for a password, so another sudoers setting takes precedence. Run “sudo -l” in Terminal to see which rules apply to you." = "Espresso 已将规则安装到 %@，但“sudo -n pmset disablesleep”仍要求输入密码，说明有其他 sudoers 设置优先生效。可在“终端”中运行“sudo -l”查看对你生效的规则。";
"Lid-sleep block is still on" = "合盖不睡眠仍处于开启状态";
"Espresso couldn’t clear “pmset disablesleep”. Run “sudo pmset disablesleep 0” in Terminal to restore normal lid behavior." = "Espresso 无法清除“pmset disablesleep”。请在“终端”中运行“sudo pmset disablesleep 0”，恢复正常的合盖行为。";
